# (a witness, a shared location, a shared source citing both), separate from
# the formal caseSeries grouping (Freeway Phantom, Silver Dollar Group),
# which is derived automatically below rather than listed twice by hand.
# Every entry here corresponds to a connection already written into the
# relevant case files' own text — this list doesn't assert anything new,
